              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 10:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo uuabila mubyali imbuto ansima yakulya uyooabila ndinywe imbuto, alimwi uyoozivuzya, akuyungizya micelo yabuuya bwanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 1:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.4.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "4:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muyoovubizigwa muzintu zyoonse akuba basibuuya lyoonse, nkabela obu buuya bwanu buli mumaanza esu buyoocitya kuti bantu balumbe Leza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.8.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 8:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo eyi milimo yabulumbu teensi yakuzuzya kubula kwabasalali luzutu, pele alimwi ilapaya kukucitya kuti bantu banji balumbe Leza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Milimo eyi ilatondezya bantu mbumubede, aboobo balalumba Leza nkaambo kakuti mulaswiilila ayo Makani Mabotu aa-Kristo ngumuzuminina, alimwi nkaambo kabuuya bwanu bwakwaabana ambabo abantu boonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela balamukombela akumusukama nkaambo kaluzyalo lwa-Leza luinda loko kuboneka kulindinywe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alumbwe Leza nkaambo kacipo cakwe citaambiki!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
